   "design": "Code checks every completed interview for inconsistencies, speeding, straight-lining and missing items and lists the flagged ones, so the researcher reviews those and a sample, instead of every record. A field dashboard shows progress and productivity, replacing the spreadsheet and manual checks. Briefings, coaching, feedback and questions stay with the researcher. No figure is used to rate interviewers without works council consent.",
